WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes can feel long
when your mind refuses to settle.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A quiet recording might make it easier
to keep an appointment with yourself.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
But a pleasant session is not proof
of a special brainwave effect.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Researchers compare alternatives,
measure outcomes, and keep failures visible.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before paying, check the package,
the evidence, and who receives your email.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try the free twelve-minute exercise first.
Then decide what a recording is worth.
